WEBVTT

00:14:26.861 --> 00:14:30.049
jer joj je facijalni nerv bio presečen.

00:14:30.049 --> 00:14:32.501
Gledao sam tamnu senu

00:14:32.501 --> 00:14:38.038
kako se širi licem moje supruge.

00:14:38.038 --> 00:14:44.139
No moja se kćer nikada nije žalila.

00:14:44.139 --> 00:14:46.200
Govorila bi nam:

00:14:46.200 --> 00:14:48.251
"Dobro mi je sa iskrivljenim osmehom

00:14:48.251 --> 00:14:50.993
i sa utrnulim licem.

00:14:50.993 --> 00:14:53.072
Biću dobro. Molim vas da ne brinete."

00:14:53.072 --> 00:14:55.201
Bila je naša uteha

00:14:55.201 --> 00:14:58.098
i olakšavala nam je bol.